{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22135","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 六 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天秋无片云，地静无纤尘。\n团团新晴月，林外生白轮。\n忆昨阴霖天，连连三四旬。\n赖逢家酝熟，不觉过朝昏。\n私言雨霁後，可以罢余尊。\n及对新月色，不醉亦愁人。\n牀头残酒榼，欲尽味弥淳。\n携置南檐下，举酌自殷勤。\n清光入杯杓，白露生衣巾。\n乃知阴与晴，安可无此君。\n我有乐府诗，成来人未闻。\n今宵醉有兴，狂咏惊四邻。\n独赏犹复尔，何况有交亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}